  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Home economics in Ukr</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Vidareutb hush&#xe5;llsl&#xe4;rare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective is to train teachers to become full-fledged Home- Economics teachers and to provide training opportunities for new groups of future teachers from seven Agricultural Institutes in Ukraine, on issues like nutrition, hygiene and diet. The  Sida-contribution amounts to SEK 1 814 800.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Utbildning av hush&#xe5;llsl&#xe4;rare i Ukraina fas 1 f&#xf6;r att h&#xf6;ja yrkeskompetensen vg hush&#xe5;llsekonomi, hygien, diet etc. hos de 21 deltagarna. Syftet p&#xe5;l&#xe5;ng sikt &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra levnadsvillkoren f&#xf6;r kvinnor och m&#xe4;n fr&#xe5;n mindre jordbrukshush&#xe5;ll. Sidas bidrag omfattar SEK 1 814 800.</narrative>
  </description>
